   "id": "file:agent.py",
   "type": "file",
   "name": "agent.py",
   "filePath": "agent.py",
   "summary": "LangGraph screening assistant: guards input, lets the model call in-process funnel tools (status, criteria, papers, columns, exports, web/PubMed/research questions, notes) under a server-checked project id, then guards the reply. Paid steps only become PendingActions the owner confirms.",
